# Local development configuration template.
# The current development checks require no environment variables.
# Add documented settings here when services start needing them.
# Use placeholders only; never commit real passwords or API keys.

# Host-only backend override: private writable directory outside the checkout.
# Compose sets /runtime and uses a named volume; do not override it with /workspace.
# CYBERSOC_RUNTIME_DIR=/absolute/private/runtime-directory
